---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 8, 2026';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Disclosure"
	description="How Homely Fusion earns income: our Amazon Associates disclosure, affiliate links, ads and sponsored content, and how we keep our recommendations honest."
	icon="💰"
	eyebrow="Full transparency"
	lede="Homely Fusion is a for-profit website. Here is, in plain English, how it earns money, and why that never changes the price you pay or the honesty of what we recommend."
	c1="#a87a1e"
	c2="#f4d479"
	chips={[`🗓️ Last updated: ${lastUpdated}`, '💵 Free for readers', '🏷️ Always labeled']}
>
	<div class="sp">
		<ul class="sp-glance">
			<li><span class="gi">🆓</span><b>No extra cost to you</b><small>Affiliate links never change the price you pay.</small></li>
			<li><span class="gi">🏷️</span><b>Clearly labeled</b><small>Sponsored content is marked, never disguised.</small></li>
			<li><span class="gi">🔎</span><b>Honest opinions</b><small>Recommendations come from research and experience.</small></li>
			<li><span class="gi">🚫</span><b>We don't sell products</b><small>All purchases happen on the retailer's site.</small></li>
		</ul>

		<nav class="sp-jump" aria-label="On this page">
			<a href="#amazon" style="--c1:#a87a1e">💵 Amazon</a>
			<a href="#affiliates" style="--c1:#35564f">🔗 Affiliates</a>
			<a href="#sponsored" style="--c1:#7a2c3a">🤝 Sponsored</a>
			<a href="#ads" style="--c1:#566485">📣 Ads</a>
			<a href="#reviews" style="--c1:#7b5b41">⭐ Reviews</a>
			<a href="#links" style="--c1:#47653d">🌐 External links</a>
			<a href="#info" style="--c1:#6b4256">ℹ️ Informational only</a>
		</nav>

		<!-- ===================== 1. AMAZON ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="amazon" style="--c1:#a87a1e;--c2:#f4d479">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">1</span><h2>Amazon Associates disclosure</h2><span class="sp-ico">💵</span></div>
			<p>
				Homely Fusion is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program
				designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and
				affiliated sites.
			</p>
			<div class="sp-note">
				<span>💵</span>
				<p>
					<strong>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> If you click a link to Amazon from
					this site and buy something, we may receive a small commission, at no additional cost to you.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 2. OTHER AFFILIATES ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="affiliates" style="--c1:#35564f;--c2:#93b9ab">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">2</span><h2>Other affiliate relationships</h2><span class="sp-ico">🔗</span></div>
			<p>
				Some links on Homely Fusion are affiliate links. If you buy a product or service through them, we may earn a
				commission, <strong>at no extra cost to you</strong>. Besides Amazon, we may take part in programs such as:
			</p>
			<ul class="sp-chips">
				<li>🛒 CJ Affiliate</li>
				<li>🛒 ShareASale</li>
				<li>🤝 PartnerStack</li>
				<li>🔗 Impact</li>
				<li>🏠 Other home-related affiliate networks</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Our recommendations are based on research, hands-on experience and editorial judgment. Affiliate links don't
				change your price or your shopping experience, and a product doesn't earn a place in a guide just because it
				pays a commission.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 3. SPONSORED ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="sponsored" style="--c1:#7a2c3a;--c2:#dc7686">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">3</span><h2>Sponsored content</h2><span class="sp-ico">🤝</span></div>
			<p>
				We may publish sponsored content or work with product partners. When we do, it is clearly labeled, so you
				always know when a brand has been involved.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 4. ADS ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="ads" style="--c1:#566485;--c2:#b3c1de">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">4</span><h2>Advertising</h2><span class="sp-ico">📣</span></div>
			<p>
				We may display third-party advertisements, which can come from networks such as Google AdSense or Mediavine.
				These networks may use cookies and similar technologies to show ads based on your interests. We aim to work
				only with advertisers that fit a home and decor audience. To learn more about cookies and your choices, see our
				<a href="/privacy-policy/#cookies">Privacy Policy</a>.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 5. REVIEWS ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="reviews" style="--c1:#7b5b41;--c2:#d1ae82">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">5</span><h2>Reviews and recommendations</h2><span class="sp-ico">⭐</span></div>
			<p>
				We write buying guides and recommendations across sofas and seating, bedroom and bathroom decor, lighting, rugs,
				wall decor, storage and more. The opinions are ours, shaped by Gilbert's 14 years of residential styling,
				research and, where possible, hands-on use. They may be influenced by affiliate relationships, which is exactly
				why we tell you about them here.
			</p>
			<div class="sp-split">
				<div class="sp-box good">
					<h3>✅ What we promise</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>🔎 Honest, researched opinions</li>
						<li>🏷️ Affiliate and sponsored links disclosed</li>
						<li>🔄 Guides updated as products change</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="sp-box limit">
					<h3>⚠️ What to keep in mind</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>💲 Prices and availability change, so check before you buy</li>
						<li>🛋️ Taste is personal: what works for one room may not suit yours</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 6. WE DON'T SELL ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="sell" style="--c1:#4a5560;--c2:#a9b6c2">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">6</span><h2>We don't sell products</h2><span class="sp-ico">🚫</span></div>
			<p>
				Homely Fusion does not manufacture or sell any physical products. Every purchase you make through a
				third-party link is governed by that seller's terms and return policy, so please read them before you buy.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 7. EXTERNAL LINKS ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="links" style="--c1:#47653d;--c2:#a3c78f">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">7</span><h2>External links</h2><span class="sp-ico">🌐</span></div>
			<p>
				Our content may link to third-party websites, including retailers, brands and other blogs. We don't control or
				endorse their content, services or privacy practices. Our <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> explain
				more.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== 8. INFO ONLY ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-card" id="info" style="--c1:#6b4256;--c2:#cf93a8">
			<div class="sp-head"><span class="sp-num">8</span><h2>Informational purposes only</h2><span class="sp-ico">ℹ️</span></div>
			<div class="sp-note warn">
				<span>ℹ️</span>
				<p>
					Everything on Homely Fusion is provided for <strong>informational and educational purposes only</strong>. We
					do our best to be accurate, but we can't guarantee the completeness of the information or the results of
					following our recommendations. For electrical, plumbing or structural work, please hire a licensed
					professional.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ===================== CTA ===================== -->
		<section class="sp-cta">
			<h2>💬 Questions about this disclosure?</h2>
			<p>If anything here isn't clear, just ask. We're happy to explain how a link or recommendation works.</p>
			<div class="sp-btns">
				<a class="sp-btn sp-btn-main" href="/contact/">📬 Contact us</a>
				<a class="sp-btn sp-btn-alt" href="/about/">🏡 About Homely Fusion</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</StaticPage>
